WEBVTT

00:00:25.063 --> 00:00:31.569
But you may also feel the conflicting
urge to squeeze

00:00:31.569 --> 00:00:33.488
or smush the kitten,

00:00:33.488 --> 00:00:35.990
maybe even stuff it in your mouth.

00:00:36.616 --> 00:00:38.576
However, you don’t.

00:00:38.785 --> 00:00:40.870
And you might be appalled by yourself.

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:44.999
But this urge, which psychologists
call “cute aggression,”

00:00:45.541 --> 00:00:51.506
is a surprisingly common one estimated
to affect about half of all adults.

00:00:52.298 --> 00:00:55.093
To better understand this
peculiar phenomenon,

00:00:55.093 --> 00:00:57.720
let's start with what cuteness is.

